Transcript fixtures for tests/integration/50_discover.sh (cg fleet discover).
The test copies them under a temporary HOME and replaces the placeholders
@SID@ (the session id), @PROJ@ (the project root) and @WT@ (the subagent's
worktree):

  claude/  -> $HOME/.claude/projects/<project root, non-alnum -> '-'>/ with
              SESSION renamed to the session id: one session with two
              subagents, agent-aaa11111 working in a worktree (its meta.json
              names worktreePath and worktreeBranch), agent-bbb22222 not
  codex/   -> $HOME/.codex/sessions/: one rollout whose cwd is the project,
              one whose cwd is elsewhere
